<title>UK: DNIB sets 110 mln guilder 7-year step-up bond.</title>
<headline>DNIB sets 110 mln guilder 7-year step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Kredietbank and Nibstrating.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DE NATIONALE INVESTERINGSBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    110 MLN DFL   COUPON  ** 5.25	MATURITY    15.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.10    SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** YEARS ONE TO FOUR, 7.25 PERCENT THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    32.5 BP   SELL CONC  1.55</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME. SENIOR AND UNSECURED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
